# MESSAGE: Surface lock — pccf:Envelope byteLength must be 736 (= 64 header + 672 bulletproof).
PREFIX pccf: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/pccf#>
PREFIX xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
SELECT ?violation ?subject WHERE {
  {
    ?subject a pccf:Envelope ; pccf:byteLength ?len .
    FILTER(?len != 736)
    BIND("PCCF_BYTELENGTH_NOT_736" AS ?violation)
  }
  UNION
  {
    ?subject a pccf:Envelope ;
             pccf:headerBytes ?h ;
             pccf:bulletproofBytes ?b .
    FILTER(?h != 64 || ?b != 672 || (?h + ?b) != 736)
    BIND("PCCF_HEADER_BULLETPROOF_SPLIT" AS ?violation)
  }
}
ORDER BY ?subject ?violation
